&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;letter-spacing:0.0pt;line-height:18.0pt;"&gt;有価証券報告書及びその添付書類並びに確認書&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:18pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
